# Frontend (apps/front)

Read **`.agents/skills/nuxt/SKILL.md`**.

- Use Nuxt UI components. Keep layouts thin.
- Every user-facing string goes through i18n (`en-US` + `fr-FR`). Use `$localePath()` for internal links.
- Call the Nest API with `apiFetch` (`credentials: "include"`). Do not store JWTs in localStorage.
- Session state: `useUser()` is `undefined` (unknown), `null` (guest), or `User`.
